VWe may also disclose information to our corporate affiliates in order to help operate our services and our affiliates\u2019 services.
p9
I1
sVContent on the Vine Archive can be collected and used by others and redistributed through the internet and other media channels.
p10
I1
sVYou may provide personal information to us, for example when you request customer support or otherwise communicate with us.
p11
I1
sVWe may share or disclose aggregated or otherwise non-personal information.
p12
I1
sVWe do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16.
p13
I1
sVWe use information we receive from you for the purposes described below, except where restricted by law.
p14
I1
sVWe may share information with such service providers on the condition that they use the data only on our behalf, pursuant to our instructions, and subject to confidentiality obligations consistent with this Privacy Policy.
p15
I1
sVIn the event Twitter is involved in a bankruptcy, merger, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of assets, information may be sold or transferred as part of that transaction.
p16
I1
sVTwitter uses Log Data for troubleshooting and related activities necessary to maintain the the Vine Archive.
p17
I1
sVTwitter may also use your personal information where reasonably necessary to comply with applicable laws, regulations, legal process, or governmental requests.
p18
I1
sVIf we become aware that a child under 16 has provided us with personal data, we will delete such information from our systems.
p19
I1
sVWhen we transfer personal data outside of the European Union or EFTA States, we ensure an adequate level of protection for the rights of data subjects based on the adequacy of the receiving country\u2019s data protection laws, contractual obligations placed on the recipient of the data (model clauses may be requested by inquiry as described below), or EU-US and Swiss-US Privacy Shield principles.
p20
I1
sVTwitter may also use your information as necessary to pursue our legitimate interests of enforcing our Terms and preventing unlawful activities and misuse of the Vine Archive; protecting the legal rights, property, safety, and security of Twitter and our users; and resolving disputes involving you relating to the Vine Archive.
p21
I1
sVWe use this information to respond to your questions or concerns.
p22
I1
sVWhere the laws of your country allow you to do so, you authorize us to transfer, store, and use your data in the United States, Ireland, and any other country where we operate.
